There are plenty of ways you can increase your chances of becoming more popular or “likable”:
- Start by introducing yourself to people when you first meet them and make sure to make eye contact;
- Show genuine interest in what they have to say;
- Listen to their opinions and don’t just talk about yourself;
- Compliment people and be sincere;
- Be open and honest when talking;
- Show that you have a good sense of humor;
- Be kind and generous;
- Show that you are reliable and trustworthy;
- Be interested in their hobbies and activities;
- Be interested in getting to know them better;
- Be interested in their feelings and thoughts;
- Show that you are interested in making the world a better place.
